      "group_id": "g0",
      "text": "44. 解下列不等式：\na) $x^2-x-90<0$；\nb) $6x^2-7x+2>0$；\nc) $-x^2-2x+48<0$；\nd) $8x^2+10x-3>0$；\ne) $25x^2-10x+1>0$；\nf) $49x^2-28x+4<0$。\ng) $-x^2-12x-100<0$；\nh) $4x^2-4x+15<0$。",
      "lines": [
        "44. 解下列不等式：",
        "a) $x^2-x-90<0$；",
        "b) $6x^2-7x+2>0$；",
        "c) $-x^2-2x+48<0$；",
        "d) $8x^2+10x-3>0$；",
        "e) $25x^2-10x+1>0$；",
        "f) $49x^2-28x+4<0$。",
        "g) $-x^2-12x-100<0$；",
        "h) $4x^2-4x+15<0$。"
      ],
